  "description": "Server-side specific extensions for Blazouter routing library. This package provides the necessary components and integration for Blazor Server applications, including the BlazouterPage component and AddBlazouterSupport extension method. Enables React Router-like routing features in Blazor Server mode with full support for nested routes, guards, lazy loading, and smooth transitions.",
